## Original Content
RÉCIT - Le terrain sur lequel des investisseurs saoudiens veulent construire trois parcs d’attractions a accueilli en 1987 un projet ambitieux qui voulait raconter nos contes et légendes. Il n’aura survécu que cinq ans.

## Summary
Mirapolis was an ambitious French theme park opened in 1987 to celebrate local tales and legends, but it failed commercially and closed after five years. The site is now being considered by Saudi investors for new amusement park developments.

## Key Points
- Mirapolis was the first major theme park in France, inaugurated in 1987.
- The park aimed to showcase French cultural stories and legends.
- It was a financial fiasco and closed within five years.
- The land is now targeted by Saudi investors for building new theme parks.


